\|_{L^2}= \|f_0\|_{L^2} \lesssim x_0^{-	heta+ rac 12},\quad E(q_0(t)) = E(f_0) \lesssim x_0^{-	heta-  rac 12}, $$ and \eqref{L2H1q} follows.\ {\it Proof of} (b). Since $p(s) = \lambda^{ rac 12}(s) q_0(s,x(s))$, \eqref{cl.1bis} follows from \eqref{surX} and \eqref{leqz3}. In particular, since $c_0<0$, $p<0$. Next, by \eqref{surX}, \eqref{leqz3} and \eqref{estfz}, splitting the two cases $\l |y|< rac {x(s)}{4}$ and $\l |y| >  rac {x(s)}{4}$, we have  egin{align} & e^{- rac{3|y|}{4}} |p(s)-q(s,y)| = e^{- rac{3|y|}{4}} \l^{ rac 12}(s) |q_0(s,x(s))-q_0(s,\l(s) y +x(s))| 
